# Copy to .env (git-ignored) for demo/run.sh. Never commit real keys.
# Ethereum mainnet JSON-RPC used only as the anvil fork source; defaults to the public tenderly
# gateway when unset. A private endpoint (Alchemy, Infura, Tenderly with key) forks faster.
MAINNET_RPC_URL=
# Optional: pin the fork block (re-runs then hit anvil's on-disk fork cache). Must be a block in
# which the Chainlink ETH/USD feed updated, or settle voids the round for a stale feed.
FORK_BLOCK=
